            <summary style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#666;cursor:pointer;">📝 Commit Watcher Prompt</summary>
            <pre style="background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:4px;padding:0.6rem;font-size:0.6rem;color:#888;overflow-x:auto;margin-top:0.3rem;white-space:pre-wrap;">Monitor GitHub commits/releases for coding agents. Write INTERESTING articles with unique angles.

FIRST: Read docs/content-policy.md and docs/terminal-tool-tweets.md

THEN: Run: node scripts/agent-commit-watcher.cjs

Find releases and significant commits for all 17 agent repos. Pick the MOST interesting one.
Write with one of these angles: Security, Comparison, Prediction, Developer, Impact, Controversy.

RULES:
- Max 1 article per run
- Never boring "X released v2.0"
- Pass content-gate.cjs --strict
- Cross-post to dev.to</pre>
